-- Status: Accepted (2026-10-28). Amended (2026-10-28): the toolbar became a margin card, from the backlog.
+- Status: Accepted (2026-10-28). Amended (2026-10-28): the toolbar became a margin card, from the backlog. Amended (2026-10-29): Refine version arrows, from the backlog ([#18](https://github.com/walteraandrade/chiri-ai-editor/issues/18)).
